<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flābra</span></b> , ōrum,
			n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>blasts</i>, esp. of wind; or, concr., <i>breezes</i>, <i>winds</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flabraque ventorum violento turbine vexant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 217</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Etesia Aquilonum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 5,
					742</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">6, 730</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Boreae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 2, 27, 12</span></i>
			 (3, 23, 12 M.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lenia Austri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 6, 665</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">freta spirantibus incita flabris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 428</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 6, 719</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non hiemes illam, non flabra neque imbres
					Convellunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 293</span></i>
			.</div>
